0 FILE 21022 - Lincoln Memorial.ldr
0 The Lincoln Memorial landmark model featuring a black inscribed base, olive-green tiered platform, white columns made of bars and round plates, and submodels representing the seated Lincoln statue, flanking side structures, and columned portico roof.
0 Name: 21022 - Lincoln Memorial.ldr
0 Author: Damien Roux [Darats]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0 : see CAreadme.txt

